[Name "3...h6: the ...d6 and ...Be7 set-up"]

5... d6 { Holds e5. }
6. O-O Be7 7. Re1 { Guards e4 a second time. }
7... O-O 8. Bb3 { The bishop steps back before ...Na5 or ...d5 can hit it, and stays on the diagonal to f7. Next come h3 and Nbd2, as in the main line. } *
